# Recorded input for the card example page (widgets/card.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 200 in the
# default theme: the card at 0..130 x 0..136, the Go button at 8..41 x 32..65, the group box at
# 8..122 x 71..128 with the Wireframe checkbox at 16..114 x 103..120 (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: hover Go
frame
pointer 24 48
# 2: hold it
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: a click
frame
buttons
# 4: press in the card's padding: nothing takes it
frame
pointer 4 4
buttons left
# 5: release: nothing
frame
buttons
# 6: press Wireframe inside the group box
frame
pointer 60 111
buttons left
# 7: release: checked
frame
buttons
